      "date": "2026-05-12T10:06:03.000Z",
      "title": "APOLLOHOSP: Dwarka Hospital Development And Steady Forecasts Will Support Balanced Long Term Outlook",
      "body": "The analyst price target for Apollo Hospitals Enterprise has been adjusted slightly higher to about ₹8,802 from roughly ₹8,769, as analysts fine tune their assumptions on discount rate, profit margin and forward P/E while keeping revenue growth expectations broadly unchanged. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled for May 20, 2026 to review and approve the annual audited standalone financial results for the three months and year ended March 31, 2026, along with other matters, including consideration of a final dividend for FY 2025-2026 (Key Developments).",
