      "date": "2026-04-26T04:19:10.000Z",
      "title": "APOLLOHOSP: New Delhi Dwarka Expansion Will Support Long Term Upside Potential",
      "body": "Analysts have nudged their price target on Apollo Hospitals Enterprise slightly lower to ₹8,768.57 from ₹8,770.23, reflecting small adjustments to fair value, revenue growth, profit margin, and future P/E assumptions in their models. What's in the News The Board of Directors approved the establishment of a multi-speciality hospital at Dwarka, New Delhi at the meeting held on April 2, 2026 (Key Developments).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/healthcare/nse-apollohosp/apollo-hospitals-enterprise-shares/uchx9bse-700-new-beds-and-digital-health-will-reshape-healthcare-delivery-t7ch/updates/22-analysts-have-nudged-their-price-target-on-apollo-hospitals",
      "raw_subtype": "narrative-update"
    },
    {
      "id": "8b352342-2c98-427c-bc27-6b4aeb91cebe",
      "type": "narrative-update",
      "date": "2026-04-12T01:05:44.000Z",
      "title": "APOLLOHOSP: New Dwarka Hospital Project Will Support Future Upside",
